-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">18<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; color: #000000; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">薪酬福利：<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">执行中国石油天然气集团有限公司统一薪酬福利制度。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt 77.3pt; text-indent: -77.3pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">招聘程序：<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">1．发布招聘信息；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">2．投递简历（网址为https:\/\/zhaopin.cnpc.com.cn）；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">3．简历筛选；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">4．参加集团公司通用能力考试；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">5. &nbsp;AI面试、基础信息测评；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">6．人才测评、专业测评及面试；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">7．体检；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">8．签订就业协议和信息真实性承诺书；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">9．公示录用及递补名单；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">10．报到、入职。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt 70.65pt; text-indent: -70.7pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">招聘标准：<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">1．<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">品行端正，遵纪守法，热爱石油事业，认同中国石油企业文化和价值观；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">2．具备较强学习能力、实践能力、沟通能力、团队合作精神和敬业精神；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">3．具有扎实的专业基础，较强的事业心和责任感，良好的心理素质；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">4．身心健康，具备与工作要求相适应的身体条件；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">5．成绩优良，综合素质好，服从分配。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p class=\"15\" =\"text-indent: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"15\" =\"text-indent: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">备注：<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">1．毕业生请务必详尽、规范、如实填写应聘简历，如发现虚假信息，一经查实，取消录用资格。如已签订劳动合同，解除其劳动合同。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">2．毕业生<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">应在规定的时间内，在中国石油高校毕业生招聘平台投递简历，逾期概不受理。<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">确保简历中填写的电话、邮箱等联系方式畅通有效；投递简历时，请同时将本人成绩单（成绩单上注明专业排名）、英语等级证书、就业推荐表、荣誉证明（以上材料需教务处等相关部门加盖公章，否则不予认定）、身份证等材料的扫描件上传。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">3．招聘过程不收取任何费用，也未授权任何培训机构提供应聘辅导等，请应聘者不要向任何组织或个人交纳与辽河石化公司招聘有关的费用，谨防上当受骗。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 22pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">4.联系方式：邮箱：lhshzp@gaoxinjob.com，电话：<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; color: #000000; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">18342335360<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; color: #000000; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">、<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体; color: #000000; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正仿宋简体;\">0427-7658155、0427-7658590<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>","tags":"3f8c70db-16e5-9c8c-6a5d-e73d00d4110f","create_name":"","zhize":"","fangxiang":"","tagsList":[{"id":"3f8c70db-16e5-9c8c-6a5d-e73d00d4110f","title":"带薪年假"}],"address_extend":"","dalei_id_name":"工程技术人员","cate_id1_name":"其他类","cate_id2_name":"其他","province_id_name":"辽宁省","city_id_name":"盘锦市","com_id_info":{"logo":"f2337ec8-3b4b-8e7d-b9c5-e0b4efb83769","name":"中国石油天然气股份有限公司辽河石化分公司","hy_vip":0,"hy_over_ti